+
+-- the IP Interface table
+
+ipAddrTable OBJECT-TYPE
+        SYNTAX  SEQUENCE OF IpAddrEntry
+        ACCESS  read-only
+        STATUS  mandatory
+        ::= { ip 20 }
+
+ipAddrEntry OBJECT-TYPE
+        SYNTAX  IpAddrEntry
+        ACCESS  read-only
+        STATUS  mandatory
